  "log": [
    {
      "choice": "Go together. Down to Broad. Let her get the cab, and the lights, and whatever else goes her way tonight.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a1_roof",
      "t": 1792001256234
    },
    {
      "choice": "Nik. He has the map, the Navy Yard cameras he swore he wasn't hacking, and a headset.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "hub": true,
      "scene": "a1_calls",
      "t": 1792001289757
    },
    {
      "choice": "The glass room at the end of the hall. Whoever watches this floor sits in there. Whoever watches has a key.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          4
        ],
        "kind": "d20",
        "label": "Search the glass room",
        "nudged": false,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "fail"
      },
      "scene": "a2_seven",
      "t": 1792001349691
    },
    {
      "choice": "Everybody. Pull every line. Wake them up. Nobody stays on this floor tonight. Not one.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a2_ward",
      "t": 1792001381222
    },
    {
      "choice": "Go. Trust him. He knows his own ninety seconds better than you know anything.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a3_elevator",
      "t": 1792001397057
    },
    {
      "choice": "Run Nik's route. He's in your ear. He can see what you can't.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          6,
          3
        ],
        "kind": "move",
        "label": "Get everyone along the dry dock",
        "nudged": true,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "strong"
      },
      "scene": "a3_yard",
      "t": 1792001416942
    },
    {
      "choice": "Take Jules's hand. She's already reaching for yours. Let it all go her way.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a3_dock",
      "t": 1792001442470
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"I'll tell her. You did it. You saved it. I'll tell her myself.\"",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a3_fall",
      "t": 1792001484967
    },
    {
      "choice": "Leave him for the police. It's an accident if they find him here. He'd want his mother to have an accident, not a mystery.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a3_after",
      "t": 1792001514014
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"He said to tell you he saved it. The deposit at Jefferson. Every dollar. From the warehouse. He was proud of it.\"",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a4_saturday",
      "t": 1792001533274
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"Halcyon. The building is theirs. The truck was theirs. They left the door open, and they waited.\"",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a4_funeral",
      "t": 1792001599211
    },
    {
      "choice": "Tell her what you saw. All of it. Whatever it costs.",
      "ep": "s02e05",
      "scene": "a4_jules",
      "t": 1792001638543
    }
  ],
